B.bWj=new A.cJ("bubl","A calm floating idea board: each row is a rounded bubble that floats gently in place. Drag to place, drop one centre-on-centre to nest it, overlap two edges to link them (a directional idea-flow arrow). A tap fires onTap. Powers the bublee applet.",B.bip,!1)
