B.bWU=new A.cJ("compose","An auto-layout screen composer: a pannable workboard of device frames. Drop a widget chip and the screen RE-SOLVES as a real layout (top/bottom regions stack fixed-height chrome, the body splits remaining space among fill widgets) instead of drawing a static mock. Self-contained chip palette; flows draw light arrows widget->screen; a Play toggle tweens the camera to a tapped widget's linked screen. Powers the `composer` applet.",B.b3D,!1)
B.c2D=new A.t("level",B.Z,"Level definition (length, groundY, platforms, enemies, goalX).",B.e,null)
B.c9H=new A.t("scoresTable",B.az,"Optional table to persist high scores into.",B.e,null)
