B.bVW=new A.cJ("slider",'A minimal, single-value horizontal slider (min/max/step/value from JSON) \u2014 distinct from `datarange` (a dual-thumb column filter): this is a general-purpose control whose live value can write a named board SETTING (`setting`, readable elsewhere via the existing "$setting:<key>" token) and/or fire an arbitrary `action` (any literal "$value" in the action\'s args, however deeply nested, is substituted with the current number before firing) \u2014 e.g. driving `mapSetFilter`/`mapSetPaint` directly to threshold a map choropleth by a live budget value. Either, both, or neither may be set; debounced ~80ms while dragging, always flushed once on release.',B.bee,!1)
