B.c2t=new A.t("recursive",B.W,'An item can have BOTH its own detail AND children (no folder/file split) \u2014 every selected item shows its detail, any item with children is expandable, and "New <item>"/addItems add a child of the selected item.',B.e,null)
B.c4r=new A.t("ownerColumn",B.x,"When set AND a rowId is injected (this explorer is itself a master-detail DETAIL child), the list filters to rows whose value in this column equals that injected id, and new rows are stamped with it.",B.e,null)
B.cfK=new A.t("detailedView",B.W,"Two-level rail: column 2 (contents) offers a Directory \u27f7 Detailed toggle in its header \u2014 compact rows vs. a per-row progress DASHBOARD (status chip, progress bar, subtask/log-entry counts, the existing `tags` chips for priority/importance/due/assignee, and a one-line latest-activity preview), plus a compact done/active/queued rollup summary + bar at the top of the column for the open folder. Reads the existing showProgress rollup cache; never a second board walk.",B.e,null)
