B.c5z=new A.t("settingsAction",B.Z,"Opt-in: {fn, args?, label?} \u2014 a gear affordance shown next to a selected FOLDER's detail header, fired with that row's id (like menuActions, but a single, separate surface for FEATURE settings \u2014 e.g. sharing/members \u2014 kept distinct from the row \u22ee menu's quick actions and from the attributes/edit-details form's data fields).",B.e,null)
B.c5t=new A.t("rootDashboard",B.W,'Two-level rail: the synthetic root ("Projects", nothing selected) gets a COMPUTED cross-project progress dashboard as its detail \u2014 overall done/active/queued rollup plus one row per top-level project \u2014 built from the existing showProgress rollup cache. The root stays synthetic: no new record, no reparenting.',B.e,null)
