B.cbP=new A.t("linkFromTitleColumn",B.x,'linksTable column that also receives the FROM note\'s own title (default "fromTitle") \u2014 kept in sync on every wiki-link sync pass and on rename of the source note. Lets a backlinks view label each row with the source without a join.',B.e,null)
